main

# --- Restored rules ---------------------------------------------------------
# The block above replaced a tracked .gitignore from the initial commit and
# dropped these. Re-appended so secrets and workspace/coverage artifacts stay
# ignored (config.json already carries DB credentials, so .env is a plausible
# future home for secrets).

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
coverage.*
!coverage.go
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
